    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "303a01a4b327ec94",
      "translationZh": "我们在 ExLlamaV3 之上构建了一个引擎 Kyojin，用于 Strix Halo（gfx1151，ROCm），并将两个 300B 级的 MoE 模型打包，使每个模型都能放入一台 128 GB 机器。首次发布，所有测试均在 Ryzen AI Max+ 395 上进行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "791605f0401fa415",
      "translationZh": "模型 GLM-5.3-Flash MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc0bbc7033d3932a",
      "translationZh": "580 tok/s 在 3.5K，546 在 64K",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e8e414c3994667",
      "translationZh": "32 散文 / 35 聊天 / 44 代码（推测），29 纯文本",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5743319d4a55e710",
      "translationZh": "Top-1 与 FP8 一致",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f648b0366562a56",
      "translationZh": "权重来源。MiMo 是我们自己的量化方法。GLM 打包混合了 turboderp 公开的 2.05 和 3.05 bpw EXL3 张量，加上我们的层混合和一个小的调优阶段。在相同的 129 行数据上，他的 2.05 bpw 打包（85 GB）得到 KLD 0.275；我们的混合（100 GB）得到 KLD 0.190。他的体积更小，解码速度大约快 10%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8f97913a962ec05",
      "translationZh": "未审查版本。单独的 -Uncensored 仓库：相同的权重加上一个引擎在加载时应用的小文件，以及一个开关用于关闭它。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb08c93c716c3d6d",
      "translationZh": "尚未测量。MiMo 和 GLM 在 128K 上下文中的任务套件得分，任何除 gfx1151 以外的 GPU。转换流程保持私有。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78d6e7ba243de346",
      "translationZh": "快速开始。克隆， ./build.sh , hf download yamz-labs/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-Yamz , python tools/glm/serve.py --model ./glm-pack -c 131072 --num-draft 2 . 您将获得类似 OpenAI 的 API。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93b15c580f24a665",
      "translationZh": "模型：https://huggingface.co/yamz-labs",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "039021ee02ed5f25",
      "translationZh": "引擎：https://github.com/Yamz-Labs/kyojin",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d291dd920b3d8f7b",
      "translationZh": "基于 turboderp's ExLlamaV3，带有 ROCm 工作来自 sdougbrown 和 vcruz305。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78a96f831deee156",
      "translationZh": "如果您拥有一台 Strix Halo 机器，我们很乐意看到您的 tok/s。问题、基准测试和 PR 都欢迎。我们应该接下来做哪个模型？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
